constraints:
1 ≤ N ≤ 3 x 10^{4}
1 ≤ Q ≤ 10^{4}
1 ≤ |li[i]|, |x| ≤ 100

expected time complexity: O(Q*x) + O(N*L) Where Q is the number of queries, x is the longest word in the query, N = number of words inserted in Trie and L = length of longest word inserted in Trie.
expected auxiliary space: O(N*List [i])

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def prefixCount(self, N, Q, li, query):
		dic = {}
		for i in range(N):
			strr = ''
			for j in li[i]:
				strr += j
				if strr not in dic:
					dic[strr] = 1
				else:
					dic[strr] += 1
		ans = []
		for i in query:
			if i in dic:
				ans.append(dic[i])
			else:
				ans.append(0)
		return ans
